      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRING COSMIC (2) has recorded back to back wins, last time scoring at this track over 440m by 1.75 lengths (24.87). The one to beat again. TAW MYSTIQUE (1) goes very well here starting eight times for four wins and three minors. Placed last time (24.89) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten 2.75 lengths. Suited here and expected to run well. FREIGHT EXPRESS (4) is a consistent runner who is new to this track. Quickly into stride and led throughout to score by one length last time over 324m at Richmond Straight (17.58). Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Sure to be thereabouts. MELLCAT BAD BOY (5) did the right thing for favourite backers last time - another big run is on the cards.",
